From e3617f072c42815b6293b9f903ca02bbbd198898 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ingenium-bot <ingenium-bot@local>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:49:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ingenium): State Must-do + Build-title + Identity spray
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Class-wide (not Maintenance one-offs): wire state Draft→Done / Draft to Done
range cues into Must-do + residual selection (no Cancel invent); Diagnosis/
canvas title from business noun (never Build Maintenance); drop uncued
x_company_id / Contact / Purchase Order / Invoice Identity M2Os; Online-honest
stock moves → honesty stamp (Parts stay product+qty). Install grammar +
first-try + Prefer Project + Vehicle stay green.
